<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-BELLSOUTH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELLSOUTH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BellSouth Open tennis tournament</p>
<p>second round results on Wednesday (Prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech) beat Cecil Mamiit (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>5-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Alberto Berasetegui (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3.</p>
</text>
